  "description": {
    "raw": "This functions as psychic crush IV, but on a successful Fortitude or Will save, the target takes 11d6 points of damage + 1 point of damage per caster level. If it is at fewer than half its total hit points, the target takes a –2 penalty on the Will save to resist this spell. This spell can be undercast.",
    "search_text": "\"this functions as psychic crush iv, but on a successful fortitude or will save, the target takes 11d6 points of damage + 1 point of damage per caster level. if it is at fewer than half its total hit points, the target takes a –2 penalty on the will save to resist this spell. this spell can be undercast.\"",
